<title>USA: Home Federal Bancorp Q2 Dec 31 net up.</title>
<headline>Home Federal Bancorp Q2 Dec 31 net up.</headline>
<dateline>SEYMOUR, Ind. 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Dollars in thousands except share data)  Second Quarter Ended Dec 31:	 1996	1995</p>
<p> Net Interest Income		 $ 5,661   $  4,904</p>
<p> Provision for Loan Losses	     267	  182</p>
<p> Net Income				2,166	1,904</p>
<p> Earnings per share, equivalents    0.63	 0.55</p>
<p>Six Months Ended December 31:</p>
<p> Net Interest Income		  11,124	9,638</p>
<p> Provision for Loan Losses	     434	  249</p>
<p> Net Income				2,597	3,697</p>
<p> Earnings per share, equivalents    0.75	1.08</p>
<p> Average shares outstanding    3,448,937  3,422,004</p>
<p>Assets $650.4 million vs $595.0 million</p>
<p>Deposits $506.4 million vs $470.7 million</p>
<p>Net loans $543.1 million vs $480.9 million.</p>
<p>NOTE: Current year-to-date results include $3.0 million pretax Savings Association Insurance Fund charge.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
